    "quotes": [
      {
        "text": "The steps above are repeated in the following phases that go from creating a premise to having a Business Scenario that has been approved by the leaders of the business. This Business Scenario document is then placed in the Requirements Repository as the high-level requirements statement that drives the architecture work downstream and is used to validate the quality of the architecture.",
