        "text": "The ratio of projects or resources employed in the enterprise is normally several magnitudes higher than the capacity of the team providing the EA Capability. To replicate key efforts of the team providing the EA Capability, a capability model provides the template with which the EA function can be scaled to cover the entire enterprise.",
