        "text": "Most likely, the sponsor of the EA Capability has already defined how the team interfaces with the rest of the enterprise. Figure 9-1 shows some of the variants of organizational alignment of a team providing the EA Capability in the industry. They are used to convey an idea and do not account for preferences like customer segment, product lines, or country and geography an enterprise may have. It is likely that the enterprise is experimenting with EA and has chartered the Leader to work with external consultants and service providers. This document does not take into account where the professionals come from.",
