          "G21H:p0040:b002"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Defines value from a client perspective. It analyzes a client’s job-to-be done; their pain points and gains. It also covers the emotional dimension of the experience, starting from an outside-in view that places customer needs and problems at the center. Design thinking and market research are incorporated into the broader Agile architecting discipline.",
